    {
      "id": "claim_540896714b0343c1a34c9af5dd6f44ad",
      "statement": "MEMMAP.md still says CS1 is pin 25 and the on-board configuration flash is not used, which predates the tile build that boots from that flash over MSPI pins 59-62 while pin 25 is I2S BCLK.",
