    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a0b85b57a12047008c9e194e70df4639",
      "statement": "MEMMAP.md describes the UART divisor 234 as the 27 MHz value, while the RTL derives the divisor from CLK_HZ divided by BAUD, making 234 correct only for a 27 MHz CPU clock.",
